02:44:49.380 --> 02:44:50.780
He was silent.

02:44:50.780 --> 02:44:53.380
And I guessed it, his unutterable depression.

02:44:53.380 --> 02:44:56.900
I feel far away from her, he said.

02:44:56.900 --> 02:44:59.180
It's hard to make her understand.

02:44:59.180 --> 02:45:00.820
Do you mean about the dance?

02:45:00.820 --> 02:45:01.820
The dance.

02:45:01.820 --> 02:45:05.300
He dismissed all the dances he had given with a snap of his fingers.

02:45:05.300 --> 02:45:08.380
Old sport, the dance is unimportant.

02:45:08.380 --> 02:45:13.180
He wanted nothing less of daisy than that she should go to Tom and say, I never loved

02:45:13.180 --> 02:45:14.500
you.

02:45:14.500 --> 02:45:18.100
After she had obliterated four years with that sentence, they could decide upon the

02:45:18.100 --> 02:45:20.300
