02:45:29.820 --> 02:45:33.220
She used to be able to understand, we'd sit for hours.

02:45:33.220 --> 02:45:37.740
He broke off and began to walk up and down a desolate path of fruit-rines and discarded

02:45:37.740 --> 02:45:40.860
