02:47:31.420 --> 02:47:40.980
At his lips touch she blossomed for him like a flower, and the incarnation was complete.

02:47:40.980 --> 02:47:46.820
Through all he said, even through his appalling sentimentality I was reminded of something,

02:47:46.820 --> 02:47:54.220
and elusive rhythm, a fragment of lost words that I had heard somewhere a long time ago.

02:47:54.220 --> 02:47:59.260
For a moment of phrase tried to take shape in my mouth and my lips parted like a dumb

02:47:59.260 --> 02:48:05.220
man's, as though there was more struggling upon them than a whisper startled there, but

02:48:05.220 --> 02:48:13.100
they made no sound, and what I had almost remembered was uncommunicable forever.

